{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24636","headline":"会昌二年春题池西小楼 · 白居易","name":"会昌二年春题池西小楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花边春水水边楼，一坐经今四十秋。\n望月桥倾三遍换，采莲船破五回修。\n园林一半成乔木，邻里三分作白头。\n苏李冥蒙随烛灭，陈樊漂泊逐萍流。\n虽贫眼下无妨乐，纵病心中不与愁。\n自笑灵光岿然在，春来游得且须游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}